name: sim.getScriptInt32Param
description: Deprecated. Use sim.getObjectInt32Param instead
luaSynopsis: int parameter = sim.getScriptInt32Param(int scriptHandle, int parameterID)
pythonSynopsis: int parameter = sim.getScriptInt32Param(int scriptHandle, int parameterID)
inputs:
1. scriptHandle: handle of the script
2. parameterID: identifier of the parameter to retrieve. See the list of all possible script parameters
outputs:
1. parameter: retrieved parameter.
